## Arrays
An array is an
*ordered* collection of values of the *same type*.
For example:
```
db> select [1, 2, 3];
{[1, 2, 3]}
db> select ['hello', 'world'];
{['hello', 'world']}
db> select [(1, 2), (100, 200)];
{[(1, 2), (100, 200)]}
```

